# Nova and Robo: a starter for cartoons in space. A small astronaut and a small robot on a small moon, a voice from home that takes its time to arrive, and nothing to hear but breathing.
# Everything in it is from the film library (`set moonbase`, `cast nova`, `cast robot`), so a new story needs only new lines. The toon look draws it as a cartoon. In the vacuum the only sound is
# `ambience breath`; a line said `radio` comes over the suit's radio, and `delay S` is how long it took to get here. `hud` lines are the helmet's display; `flightpath` draws the way home on the sky.
film    nova-and-robo
name    Nova and Robo
about   A small astronaut and a small robot on a small moon, and a voice from home that takes its time to arrive.
tags    space, cartoon
still   12
music   none
toon    bands 3  lines 2.5  saturation 1.25
title   at 0.5 for 3

part "The long walk"
set     moonbase
length  11
gravity 1.62
ambience breath 1
cast    nova  at -4 0 6  facing 180
walk    nova  0.5 0.8   -1.5 1
hud     "AIR 96%"  at -0.84 0.82  size 0.035
hud     "HOME 384,400 KM"  at 0.5 0.82  size 0.035  from 3
say     nova  6.5 "Hello? Can anyone hear me?" radio
shot 0 A long way from anywhere
  key   -9 3.5 12   -2 1 2   36
  key   -7 2.6 9   -1.5 1 1   36
  subject nova

part "Mission control" dissolve 0.8
set     void
length  7
ambience night 0.3
space   stars 1  milkyway 0.5  sun 60 12
interior cockpit  at 0 0 4  facing 180  light 0.9 0.95 1
screen  board  at 1.25 1.75 0.85  show radar  size 0.9 0.6  facing 345  bright 1.4
hologram home  globe  at -0.9 1.45 1.3  size 0.45  colour 0.4 0.8 1
cast    chief as pip  at 0.1 0 1.45  facing 0
gesture chief  "cheer" 3 3.4 5 5.4
say     chief  2.2 "We hear you, Nova! Look behind you."
shot 0 The room
  key   0 1.25 3.6   0.1 0.85 0.4   40
  subject chief

part "Who is that?" dissolve 0.8
set     moonbase
length  12
gravity 1.62
ambience breath 1
cast    nova  at -1.5 0 1  facing 0
cast    robot  at 2 0 -3  facing 0
cast    chief as pip  at 60 0 60
walk    robot  1 0.8   -0.4 -0.6
walk    nova  2.2 0.4   -1.6 0.6
hud     "AIR 94%"  at -0.84 0.82  size 0.035
say     chief   0.2 "We hear you, Nova! Look behind you." radio delay 1.3
gesture nova  "nod" 3.4 3.8 5 5.6
gesture nova  "wave" 6.5 7 8 8.5
gesture robot  "cheer" 8 8.5 10.5 11
say     nova  6.8 "Oh! Hello, you."
shot 0 Nova turns
  key   -3.6 1.1 2.6   -1 0.75 -0.4   34
  subject nova
shot 5.5 Two small friends
  key   3 1.2 2.4   -0.8 0.7 -0.2   36
  subject robot

part "Home" dissolve 1
set     moonbase
length  10
gravity 1.62
ambience breath 1
cast    nova  at -0.7 0 0  facing 150
cast    robot  at 0.6 0 0.2  facing 210
planet  here  rocky  at 0 -40 0  radius 1
flightpath here home "HOME"  from 3  over 4
gesture nova  "cheer" 5 5.5 8.5 9
gesture robot  "cheer" 5.3 5.8 8.5 9
say     nova  5.2 "There it is. Home." radio
shot 0 Looking up
  key   1 0.5 4.6   -1.4 2.8 -8   38
  key   1.4 0.45 5   -1.8 3.4 -8   38
  subject nova
